msgid "<a href=\":fontawesome_url\">Font Awesome</a> is an iconic font and CSS toolkit. Font Awesome gives you scalable vector icons that can instantly be customized — size, color, drop shadow, and anything that can be done with the power of CSS. For more information on how to use Font Awesome, see the <a href=\":fontawesome_examples_page\">Font Awesome Examples page</a>."
msgstr "<a href=\":fontawesome_url\">Font Awesome</a> 是一個圖示字型和 CSS 工具箱。 Font Awesome 為您提供可立即自訂的可調式向量圖示 - 大小、顏色、陰影效果，以及任何可以使用 CSS 功能完成的作業。 如需如何使用 Font Awesome 的相關資訊，請參閱 <a href=\":fontawesome_examples_page\">Font Awesome 範例頁面</a>。"

msgid "The Font Awesome library could not be found. Please verify Font Awesome is installed correctly or that the CDN has been activated and properly configured. Please see the @adminPage and the Font Awesome module README file for more details."
msgstr "找不到 Font Awesome 程式庫。 請驗證 Font Awesome 已正確安裝，或 CDN 已啟動並適當配置。 如需詳細資料，請參閱 @adminPage 及 Font Awesome 模組 README 檔。"

msgid "admin page"
msgstr "管理頁面"

msgid "HTML Markup"
msgstr "HTML 標記"

msgid "Choose the HTML markup tag that Font Awesome icons should be created with. Typically, this is a %tag tag, however it can be changed to suite the theme requirements."
msgstr "選擇應該用來建立 Font Awesome 圖示的 HTML 標記標籤。 一般而言，這是一個 %tag 標籤，不過它可以變更為套組佈景主題需求。"

msgid "Font Awesome"
msgstr "Font Awesome"

msgid "Library being loaded manually"
msgstr "正在手動載入程式庫"

msgid "The Font Awesome module is configured not to load the Font Awesome library. If this is an error, please see the @adminPage and the Font Awesome module README file for more details."
msgstr "Font Awesome 模組已配置為不載入 Font Awesome 程式庫。 如果這是錯誤，請參閱 @adminPage 及 Font Awesome 模組 README 檔，以取得詳細資料。"

msgid "Webfonts with CSS"
msgstr "Webfonts with CSS"

msgid "CDN SVG with JS"
msgstr "CDN SVG with JS"

msgid "SVG with JS"
msgstr "SVG with JS"

msgid "All icons loaded"
msgstr "已載入所有圖示"

msgid "Solid icons loaded"
msgstr "已載入單色圖示"

msgid "Regular icons loaded"
msgstr "已載入一般圖示"

msgid "Light icons loaded"
msgstr "已載入淺色圖示"

msgid "Brands icons loaded"
msgstr "已載入品牌圖示"

msgid "Font Awesome library is installed. Using %version version. (@moreInfoLink)"
msgstr "已安裝 Font Awesome 程式庫。 使用 %version 版。(@moreInfoLink)"

msgid "more information"
msgstr "相關資訊"

msgid "Not installed"
msgstr "未安裝"

msgid "The Font Awesome library could not be found. If you want this module to handle loading your FontAwesome assets, please verify Font Awesome is installed correctly or that the CDN has been activated and properly configured. Please see the @adminPage and the Font Awesome module README file for more details."
msgstr "找不到 Font Awesome 程式庫。 如果您想要此模組處理載入 FontAwesome 資產，請驗證 Font Awesome 已正確安裝，或 CDN 已啟動並適當配置。 如需詳細資料，請參閱 @adminPage 及 Font Awesome 模組 README 檔。"

msgid "The most popular icon set and toolkit on the web."
msgstr "Web 上最熱門的圖示集和工具箱。"

msgid "Font Awesome Settings"
msgstr "Font Awesome 設定"

msgid "Global settings for the display of Font Awesome icons."
msgstr "顯示 Font Awesome 圖示的廣域設定。"

msgid "Access fontawesome additional settings"
msgstr "存取 fontawesome 其他設定"

msgid "Grants access to the additional settings in fontawesome fields type. Without this permission, only the icon can be selected."
msgstr "授與存取 fontawesome 欄位類型中的其他設定。 如果沒有此許可權，則只能選取圖示。"

msgid "Font Awesome settings"
msgstr "Font Awesome 設定"

msgid "Add Font Awesome Icon"
msgstr "新增 Font Awesome 圖示"

msgid "Tag used for Font Awesome elements"
msgstr "用於 Font Awesome 元素的標籤"

msgid "Method used for delivering Font Awesome"
msgstr "用於遞送 Font Awesome 的方法"

msgid "Let module handle loading FontAwesome assets"
msgstr "讓模組處理載入 FontAwesome 資產"

msgid "Use CDN to serve Font Awesome"
msgstr "使用 CDN 來提供 Font Awesome"

msgid "Location of the external CDN for Font Awesome"
msgstr "Font Awesome 的外部 CDN 位置"

msgid "Use Shim File for v4 compatibility"
msgstr "使用 Shim 檔案以取得 v4 相容性"

msgid "Location of the external CDN for Font Awesome shim file"
msgstr "Font Awesome shim 檔案的外部 CDN 位置"

msgid "Allow CSS pseudo elements with webfonts"
msgstr "容許具有 webfonts 的 CSS 虛擬元素"

msgid "Use the Font Awesome solid icons file"
msgstr "使用 Font Awesome 單色圖示檔"

msgid "Use the Font Awesome regular icons file"
msgstr "使用 Font Awesome 一般圖示檔"

msgid "Use the Font Awesome light icons file"
msgstr "使用 Font Awesome 淺色圖示檔"

msgid "Use the Font Awesome brands icons file"
msgstr "使用 Font Awesome 品牌圖示檔"

msgid "Use the Font Awesome duotone icons file"
msgstr "使用 Font Awesome 雙色調圖示檔"

msgid "Use the Font Awesome thin icons file"
msgstr "使用 Font Awesome 小型圖示檔"

msgid "Integrity value of the external CDN for Font Awesome"
msgstr "Font Awesome 的外部 CDN 的完整性值"

msgid "Bypass Font Awesome validation"
msgstr "略過 Font Awesome 驗證"

msgid "Use the Font Awesome sharp regular icons file"
msgstr "使用 Font Awesome 清晰一般圖示檔"

msgid "Use the Font Awesome sharp light icons file"
msgstr "使用 Font Awesome 清晰淺色圖示檔"

msgid "Use the Font Awesome sharp solid icons file"
msgstr "使用 Font Awesome 清晰單色圖示檔"

msgid "Use the Font Awesome custom icons file"
msgstr "使用 Font Awesome 自訂圖示檔"

msgid "Font Awesome Icon formatter settings"
msgstr "Font Awesome 圖示格式製作程式設定"

msgid "Display multi-value fields as layers?"
msgstr "將多值欄位顯示為層？"

msgid "Font Awesome IconPicker"
msgstr "Font Awesome IconPicker"

msgid "The fontIconPicker library is installed."
msgstr "已安裝 fontIconPicker 程式庫。"

msgid "The fontIconPicker library could not be found. To use the Font Awesome Iconpicker, please verify that the fontIconPicker library is installed correctly. Please see the Font Awesome Iconpicker submodule README file for more details."
msgstr "找不到 fontIconPicker 程式庫。 若要使用 Font Awesome Iconpicker，請驗證已正確安裝 fontIconPicker 程式庫。 如需詳細資料，請參閱 Font Awesome Iconpicker 子模組 README 檔。"

msgid "Font Awesome Iconpicker Widget"
msgstr "Font Awesome Iconpicker 小組件"

msgid "Provides an iconpicker widget for Font Awesome"
msgstr "提供 Font Awesome 的 Iconpicker 小組件"

msgid "IconPicker already present at @path. No download required."
msgstr "IconPicker 已存在於 @path。 不需要下載。"

msgid "Drush was unable to download the fontIconPicker library from @remote."
msgstr "Drush 無法從 @remote 下載 fontIconPicker 程式庫。"

msgid "Error: unable to download fontIconPicker library from @remote"
msgstr "錯誤：無法從 @remote 下載 fontIconPicker 程式庫"

msgid "fontIconPicker library has been successfully downloaded to @path."
msgstr "fontIconPicker 程式庫已順利下載至 @path。"

msgid "Drush was unable to load the fontIconPicker) library"
msgstr "Drush 無法載入 fontIconPicker 程式庫"

msgid "Icon Name"
msgstr "圖示名稱"

msgid "Invalid icon"
msgstr "無效圖示"

msgid "Font Awesome Media Entity"
msgstr "Font Awesome 媒體實體"

msgid "Adds a Font Awesome Media Entity Type."
msgstr "新增 Font Awesome 媒體實體類型。"

msgid "Name of the Font Awesome Icon. See @iconsLink for valid icon names, or begin typing for an autocomplete list. Note that all four versions of the icon will be shown - Light, Regular, Solid, Duotone, and Thin respectively. If the icon shows a question mark, that icon version is not supported in your version of Fontawesome."
msgstr "Font Awesome 圖示的名稱。 如需有效的圖示名稱，請參閱 @iconsLink，或開始鍵入以取得自動完成清單。 請注意，將會顯示圖示的所有四個版本 - 分別為「淺色」、「一般」、「單色」、「雙色調」及「小型」。 如果圖示顯示問號，您的 Fontawesome 版本不支援該圖示版本。"

msgid "the Font Awesome icon list"
msgstr "Font Awesome 圖示清單"

msgid "Add"
msgstr "新增"

msgid "Title"
msgstr "標題"

msgid "Font Awesome Icon"
msgstr "Font Awesome 圖示"

msgid "Use a Font Awesome Icon for reusable media."
msgstr "對可重複使用的媒體使用 Font Awesome 圖示。"

msgid "Font Awesome already present at @path. No download required."
msgstr "Font Awesome 已存在於 @path。 不需要下載。"

msgid "Drush was unable to download the Font Awesome library from @remote."
msgstr "Drush 無法從 @remote 下載 Font Awesome 程式庫。"

msgid "Error: unable to download Fontawesome library from @remote"
msgstr "錯誤：無法從 @remote 下載 Fontawesome 程式庫"

msgid "Fontawesome library has been successfully downloaded to @path."
msgstr "Fontawesome 程式庫已順利下載至 @path。"

msgid "Drush was unable to load the Font Awesome library"
msgstr "Drush 無法載入 Font Awesome 程式庫"

msgid "For more information on icon selection, see @iconLink. If an icon below is displayed with a question mark, it is likely a Font Awesome Pro icon, unavailable with the free version of Font Awesome."
msgstr "如需圖示選擇的相關資訊，請參閱 @iconLink。 如果下面的圖示顯示問號，則可能是 Font Awesome Pro 圖示，免費版本 Font Awesome 無法使用。"

msgid "Name of the Font Awesome Icon. See @iconsLink for valid icon names, or begin typing for an autocomplete list."
msgstr "Font Awesome 圖示的名稱。 如需有效的圖示名稱，請參閱 @iconsLink，或開始鍵入以取得自動完成清單。"

msgid "Additional Font Awesome Settings"
msgstr "其他 Font Awesome 設定"

msgid "Style"
msgstr "樣式"

msgid "This changes the style of the icon. Please note that this is not available for all icons, and for some of the icons this is only available in the pro version. If the icon does not render properly in the preview above, the icon does not support that style. Notably, brands do not support any styles. See @iconLink for more information."
msgstr "這會變更圖示的樣式。 請注意，這並非適用於所有圖示，而對於部分圖示，這僅適用於 Pro 版本。 如果圖示在上述預覽中未適當地呈現，則圖示不支援該樣式。 值得注意的是，品牌不支援任何樣式。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 @iconLink。"

msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgid "This increases icon sizes relative to their container"
msgstr "這會相對於其儲存器增加圖示大小"

msgid "Default"
msgstr "預設值"

msgid "Extra Small"
msgstr "特小"

msgid "Small"
msgstr "小"

msgid "Large"
msgstr "大型"

msgid "2x"
msgstr "2x"

msgid "3x"
msgstr "3x"

msgid "4x"
msgstr "4x"

msgid "5x"
msgstr "5x"

msgid "6x"
msgstr "6x"

msgid "7x"
msgstr "7x"

msgid "8x"
msgstr "8x"

msgid "9x"
msgstr "9x"

msgid "10x"
msgstr "10x"

msgid "Fixed Width?"
msgstr "固定寬度？"

msgid "Use to set icons at a fixed width. Great to use when different icon widths throw off vertical alignment. Especially useful in things like nav lists and list groups."
msgstr "用來設定固定寬度的圖示。 當不同的圖示寬度無法垂直對齊時，非常適合使用。 在導覽清單和清單群組等方面特別有用。"

msgid "Border?"
msgstr "邊框？"

msgid "Adds a border to the icon."
msgstr "將邊框新增至圖示。"

msgid "Invert color?"
msgstr "反轉顏色？"

msgid "Inverts the color of the icon (black becomes white, etc.)"
msgstr "反轉圖示的顏色（黑色變成白色等）"

msgid "Animation"
msgstr "動畫"

msgid "Use spin to get any icon to rotate, and pulse to have it rotate with 8 steps. Works especially well with fa-spinner & everything in the @iconLink."
msgstr "使用旋轉可讓任何圖示旋轉，並使用脈衝可讓它以 8 個步驟旋轉。 與 fa-spinner 和 @iconLink 中的所有內容配合使用效果特別好。"

msgid "spinner icons category"
msgstr "微調按鈕圖示種類"

msgid "None"
msgstr "無"

msgid "Spin"
msgstr "旋轉"

msgid "Pulse"
msgstr "脈衝"

msgid "Pull"
msgstr "拉出"

msgid "This setting will pull the icon (float) to one side or the other in relation to its nearby content"
msgstr "此設定會將圖示（浮點數）拉到與其附近內容相關的一側或另一側"

msgid "Left"
msgstr "左側"

msgid "Right"
msgstr "權限"

msgid "Power Transforms"
msgstr "Power Transform"

msgid "See @iconLink for additional information on Power Transforms. Note that these transforms only work with the SVG with JS version of Font Awesome and are disabled for Webfonts. See the @adminLink to set your version of Font Awesome."
msgstr "如需 Power Transform 的相關資訊，請參閱 @iconLink。 請注意，這些轉換僅適用於 SVG with JS 版本的 Font Awesome，且針對 Webfonts 停用。 請參閱 @adminLink，以設定您的 Font Awesome 版本。"

msgid "the Font Awesome `Power Transforms` guide"
msgstr "Font Awesome `Power Transform` 手冊"

msgid "Rotate"
msgstr "旋轉"

msgid "Power Transform rotating effects icon angle without changing or moving the container. To rotate icons use any arbitrary value. Units are degrees with negative numbers allowed."
msgstr "Power Transform 旋轉效果圖示角度，無需變更或移動儲存器。 若要旋轉圖示，請使用任何任意值。 單位是容許負數的度數。"

msgid "Flip Horizontal?"
msgstr "水平翻轉？"

msgid "Power Transform flipping effects icon reflection without changing or moving the container."
msgstr "Power Transform 翻轉效果圖示反射，無需變更或移動儲存器。"

msgid "Flip Vertical?"
msgstr "垂直翻轉？"

msgid "Scale"
msgstr "比例"

msgid "Power Transform scaling effects icon size without changing or moving the container. This field will scale icons up or down with any arbitrary value, including decimals. Units are 1/16em."
msgstr "Power Transform 調整大小效果圖示大小，無需變更或移動儲存器。 此欄位將以任何任意值（包括小數）向上或向下縮放圖示。 單位為 1/16em。"

msgid "Scale Type"
msgstr "比例類型"

msgid "Shrink"
msgstr "收縮"

msgid "Grow"
msgstr "增長"

msgid "Scale Value"
msgstr "小數位數值"

msgid "Position (Y Axis)"
msgstr "位置（Y 軸）"

msgid "Power Transform positioning effects icon location without changing or moving the container. This field will move icons up or down with any arbitrary value, including decimals. Units are 1/16em."
msgstr "Power Transform 定位效應圖示位置，無需變更或移動儲存器。 此欄位將使用任何任意值（包括小數）向上或向下移動圖示。 單位為 1/16em。"

msgid "Position Type"
msgstr "位置類型"

msgid "Up"
msgstr "上移"

msgid "Down"
msgstr "下移"

msgid "Position Value"
msgstr "位置值"

msgid "Position (X Axis)"
msgstr "位置（X 軸）"

msgid "Insert Icon"
msgstr "插入圖示"

msgid "Invalid value for Font Awesome Power Transform %value. Please see @iconLink for information on correct values."
msgstr "Font Awesome Power Transform %value 的值無效。 如需正確值的相關資訊，請參閱 @iconLink。"

msgid "the Font Awesome guide to Power Transforms"
msgstr "Power Transform 的 Font Awesome 手冊"

msgid "Invalid icon name %value. Please see @iconLink for correct icon names."
msgstr "圖示名稱 %value 無效。 如需正確的圖示名稱，請參閱 @iconLink。"

msgid "Font Awesome Tag"
msgstr "Font Awesome 標籤"

msgid "&lt;i&gt;"
msgstr "&lt;i&gt;"

msgid "&lt;span&gt;"
msgstr "&lt;span&gt;"

msgid "Font Awesome works with any consistent HTML element. By default, Font Awesome uses the &lt;i&gt; tag for its icons. However, in some cases you may want to use a different tag for your Font Awesome icons, such as a &lt;span&gt; tag. Changing the value here will change the way the tags are inserted into your site. Manually created Font Awesome tags can use any HTML element you like. Note that changing this setting will require clearing the site cache."
msgstr "Font Awesome 可與任何一致的 HTML 元素搭配使用。 依預設，Font Awesome 使用 &lt;i&gt; 標籤來表示其圖示。 但是，在某些情況下，您可能想要為 Font Awesome 圖示使用不同的標籤，例如 &lt;span&gt; 標籤。 在這裡變更值將變更標籤插入網站的方式。 手動建立的 Font Awesome 標籤可以使用您喜歡的任何 HTML 元素。 請注意，變更此設定將需要清除網站快取。"

msgid "Font Awesome Method"
msgstr "Font Awesome 方法"

msgid "Web Fonts with CSS"
msgstr "Web Fonts with CSS"

msgid "This setting controls the way Font Awesome works. SVG with JS is the modern, easy, and powerful version with the most backwards compatibility. Web Fonts with CSS is the classic Font Awesome icon method that you have seen in earlier versions of Font Awesome. We recommend SVG with JS. Please note that the Webfonts with CSS version does not allow backwards compatibility with Font Awesome 4. That means you will need to check your code base to be certain that the icons are all updated to work with version 5. See @gettingStartedLink for more information."
msgstr "此設定會控制 Font Awesome 的運作方式。 SVG with JS 是現代、簡單、強大的版本，具有最大的舊版相容性。 Web Fonts with CSS 是您在舊版 Font Awesome 中看到的典型 Font Awesome 圖示方法。 我們建議 SVG with JS。請注意，Webfonts with CSS 版本不容許與 Font Awesome 4 舊版相容。 這表示您將需要檢查程式碼庫，以確定圖示已全部更新以使用第 5 版。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 @gettingStartedLink。"

msgid "the Font Awesome guide"
msgstr "Font Awesome 手冊"

msgid "Allow CSS pseudo-elements?"
msgstr "容許 CSS 虛擬元素？"

msgid "If you do not want to add icons directly in code, you can add them through CSS pseudo-elements. Font Awesome has leveraged the ::before pseudo-element to add icons to a page since the very beginning. For more information on how to use pseudo-elements, see the @pseudoElementsLink. Note that this feature is always available with the Webfonts version of Font Awesome. If you turn this feature on for SVG with JS, it will slow your site down noticeably."
msgstr "如果您不想直接在程式碼中新增圖示，則可以透過 CSS 虛擬元素來新增圖示。 Font Awesome 從一開始就利用 ::before 虛擬元素將圖示新增至頁面。 如需如何使用虛擬元素的相關資訊，請參閱 @pseudoElementsLink。 請注意，Webfonts 版本的 Font Awesome 一律提供此特性。 如果您針對 SVG with JS 開啟此特性，則會明顯減慢網站的速度。"

msgid "Font Awesome guide to pseudo-elements"
msgstr "Font Awesome 虛擬元素手冊"

msgid "Load Font Awesome library?"
msgstr "載入 Font Awesome 程式庫？"

msgid "If enabled, this module will attempt to load the Font Awesome library for you. To prevent loading twice, leave this option disabled if you're including the assets manually or through another module or theme."
msgstr "如果啟用，此模組將嘗試為您載入 Font Awesome 程式庫。 若要防止載入兩次，如果您手動或透過另一個模組或佈景主題併入資產，請保持此選項停用。"

msgid "External file configuration"
msgstr "外部檔案配置"

msgid "These settings control the method by which the Font Awesome library is loaded. You can choose to use an external (full URL) or local (relative path) library by selecting a URL / path below, or you can use a local version of the file by leaving the box unchecked and downloading the library <a href=\":remoteurl\">:remoteurl</a> and installing locally at %installpath. See the README for more information."
msgstr "這些設定控制載入 Font Awesome 程式庫的方法。 您可以選擇使用外部（完整 URL）或本端（相對路徑）程式庫，方法是選取下面的 URL/路徑；或者您可以使用檔案的本端版本，方法是不勾選此方框並下載程式庫 <a href=\":remoteurl\">:remoteurl</a> 並在本端安裝 %installpath。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 README。"

msgid "Use external file (CDN) / local file?"
msgstr "使用外部檔案 (CDN)/本端檔案？"

msgid "Checking this box will cause the Font Awesome library to be loaded from the given source rather than from the local library file."
msgstr "勾選此方框會導致從給定的來源載入 Font Awesome 程式庫，而不是從本端程式庫檔案載入 Font Awesome 程式庫。"

msgid "External File Location"
msgstr "外部檔案位置"

msgid "Enter a source URL for the external Font Awesome library file you wish to use. Note that this is designed for use with the <strong>SVG with JS</strong> method. Use for the Webfonts method at your own risk. This URL should point to the Font Awesome JS svg file when using <strong>SVG with JS</strong> or it should point to the Font Awesome CSS file when using <strong>Web Fonts with CSS</strong>. Leave blank to use the default Font Awesome CDN."
msgstr "輸入您要使用的外部 Font Awesome 程式庫檔案的來源 URL。 請注意，這是設計成與 <strong>SVG with JS</strong> 方法搭配使用。 用於 Webfonts 方法，風險自負。 當使用 <strong>SVG with JS</strong> 時，此 URL 應該指向 Font Awesome JS svg 檔案，或者當使用 <strong>Web Fonts with CSS</strong> 時，它應該指向 Font Awesome CSS 檔案。 保留空白以使用預設 Font Awesome CDN。"

msgid "External File Integrity Value"
msgstr "外部檔案完整性值"

msgid "Enter an (optional) integrity value for checking the CDN. This value should be provided by Font Awesome alongside the CDN source. This will force the browser to confirm the integrity of the CDN to prevent unexpected content from being loaded."
msgstr "輸入用於檢查 CDN 的（選用）完整性值。 此值應該由 Font Awesome 與 CDN 來源一起提供。 這將強制瀏覽器確認 CDN 的完整性，以防止載入非預期的內容。"

msgid "Partial file configuration"
msgstr "局部檔案配置"

msgid "By default, Font Awesome loads all of the icons. However, you can choose to load only some of the icon files if you only want a subset of the available icons. This method can result in reduced file size. These files will be assumed to exist in the same directory as the parent <i>all.js/all.css</i> file."
msgstr "依預設，Font Awesome 會載入所有圖示。 不過，如果您只想要可用圖示的子集，則可以選擇僅載入部分圖示檔。 此方法可能會導致檔案大小減少。 這些檔案將假設存在於與母項 <i>all.js/all.css</i> 檔案相同的目錄中。"

msgid "Load solid icons"
msgstr "載入單色圖示"

msgid "Checking this box will cause the Font Awesome library to load the file containing the solid icon declarations (<i>solid.js/solid.css</i>)"
msgstr "勾選此方框會導致 Font Awesome 程式庫載入包含單色圖示宣告的檔案 (<i>solid.js/solid.css</i>)"

msgid "Load regular icons"
msgstr "載入一般圖示"

msgid "Checking this box will cause the Font Awesome library to load the file containing the regular icon declarations (<i>regular.js/regular.css</i>)"
msgstr "勾選此方框會導致 Font Awesome 程式庫載入包含一般圖示宣告的檔案 (<i>regular.js/regular.css</i>)"

msgid "Load light icons"
msgstr "載入淺色圖示"

msgid "Checking this box will cause the Font Awesome library to load the file containing the light icon declarations (<i>light.js/light.css</i>). Note that this a Pro-only feature."
msgstr "勾選此方框會導致 Font Awesome 程式庫載入包含淺色圖示宣告 (<i>light.js/light.css</i>) 的檔案。 請注意，這是一項僅限專業的特性。"

msgid "Load brand icons"
msgstr "載入品牌圖示"

msgid "Checking this box will cause the Font Awesome library to load the file containing the brands icon declarations (<i>brands.js/brands.css</i>)"
msgstr "勾選此方框會導致 Font Awesome 程式庫載入包含品牌圖示宣告的檔案 (<i>brands.js/brands.css</i>)"

msgid "Load duotone icons"
msgstr "載入雙色調圖示"

msgid "Checking this box will cause the Font Awesome library to load the file containing the duotone icon declarations (<i>duotone.js/duotone.css</i>)"
msgstr "勾選此方框會導致 Font Awesome 程式庫載入包含雙色調圖示宣告的檔案 (<i>duotone.js/duotone.css</i>)"

msgid "Load thin icons"
msgstr "載入小型圖示"

msgid "Checking this box will cause the Font Awesome library to load the file containing the thin icon declarations (<i>thin.js/thin.css</i>)"
msgstr "勾選此方框會導致 Font Awesome 程式庫載入包含小型圖示宣告的檔案 (<i>thin.js/thin.css</i>)"

msgid "Load sharp regular icons"
msgstr "載入清晰一般圖示"

msgid "Checking this box will cause the Font Awesome library to load the file containing the sharp regular icon declarations (<i>sharp-regular.js/sharp-regular.css</i>)"
msgstr "勾選此方框會導致 Font Awesome 程式庫載入包含清晰一般圖示宣告的檔案 (<i>sharp-regular.js/sharp-regular.css</i>)"

msgid "Load sharp light icons"
msgstr "載入清晰淺色圖示"

msgid "Checking this box will cause the Font Awesome library to load the file containing the sharp light icon declarations (<i>sharp-light.js/sharp-light.css</i>)"
msgstr "勾選此方框會導致 Font Awesome 程式庫載入包含清晰圖示宣告的檔案 (<i>sharp-light.js/sharp-light.css</i>)"

msgid "Load sharp solid icons"
msgstr "載入清晰單色圖示"

msgid "Checking this box will cause the Font Awesome library to load the file containing the sharp solid icon declarations (<i>sharp-solid.js/sharp-solid.css</i>)"
msgstr "勾選此方框會導致 Font Awesome 程式庫載入包含清晰單色圖示宣告的檔案 (<i>sharp-solid.js/sharp-solid.css</i>)"

msgid "Load custom icons"
msgstr "載入自訂圖示"

msgid "Checking this box will cause the Font Awesome library to load the file containing the custom icon declarations (<i>custom-icons.js/custom-icons.css</i>)"
msgstr "勾選此方框會導致 Font Awesome 程式庫載入包含自訂圖示宣告的檔案 (<i>custom-icons.js/custom-icons.css</i>)"

msgid "Version 4 Backwards Compatibility"
msgstr "第 4 版舊版相容性"

msgid "Version 5 of Font Awesome has some changes which require modifications to the way you declare many of your icons. The settings below are designed to ease that transition. See @upgradingLink for more information."
msgstr "Font Awesome 第 5 版有一些變更需要修改您宣告許多圖示的方式。 下面的設定旨在簡化該轉移。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 @upgradingLink。"

msgid "the Font Awesome guide to upgrading version 4 to version 5"
msgstr "將第 4 版升級至第 5 版的 Font Awesome 手冊"

msgid "Use version 4 shim file?"
msgstr "使用第 4 版 shim 檔案？"

msgid "Rather than editing all of your Font Awesome declarations to use the new Font Awesome syntax, you can choose to include a shim file above. This file will allow you to use Font Awesome version 5 with Font Awesome version 4 syntax. This prevents you from needing to modify your existing code and syntax."
msgstr "您可以選擇在上方併入 shim 檔案，而不是編輯所有 Font Awesome 宣告來使用新的 Font Awesome 語法。 此檔案將容許您使用 Font Awesome 第 5 版與 Font Awesome 第 4 版語法。 這可避免您需要修改現有的程式碼和語法。"

msgid "External / local Library Location"
msgstr "外部/本端程式庫位置"

msgid "Enter a source URL for the external / local (relative path) Font Awesome v4 shim file you wish to use. This URL should point to the Font Awesome JS shim file. Leave blank to use the default Font Awesome CDN."
msgstr "輸入您要使用的外部/本端（相對路徑）Font Awesome v4 shim 檔案的來源 URL。 此 URL 應該指向 Font Awesome JS shim 檔案。 保留空白以使用預設 Font Awesome CDN。"

msgid "Bypass Font Awesome icon validation?"
msgstr "略過 Font Awesome 圖示驗證？"

msgid "If enabled, icon name validation will not take place. This is useful when using custom icons from Font Awesome's hosted kits."
msgstr "如果已啟用，則不會進行圖示名稱驗證。 當使用 Font Awesome 管理套件中的自訂圖示時，這非常有用。"

msgid "Invalid external library location."
msgstr "外部程式庫位置無效。"

msgid "Insert Font Awesome Icon"
msgstr "插入 Font Awesome 圖示"

msgid "Drupal Font Awesome"
msgstr "Drupal Font Awesome"

msgid "Layers are the new way to place icons and text visually on top of each other, replacing the Font Awesome classic icons stacks. With this new approach you can use more than 2 icons. Layers are awesome when you don’t want your page’s background to show through, or when you do want to use multiple colors, layer several icons, layer text, or layer counters onto an icon. Note that layers only work with the SVG version of Font Awesome. For more information, see @layersLink."
msgstr "圖層是將圖示和文字以視覺化方式放在彼此之上的新方法，取代 Font Awesome 的典型圖示堆疊。 使用此新方法，您可以使用超過 2 個圖示。 當您不想要顯示頁面背景時，或當您想要在圖示上使用多種顏色、層數個圖示、層文字或層計數器時，層是很棒的。 請注意，層只能使用 SVG 版本的 Font Awesome。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 @layersLink。"

msgid "the Font Awesome guide to layers"
msgstr "Font Awesome 層手冊"

msgid "Display multi-value fields as layers: <strong>@layersSetting</strong>"
msgstr "將多值欄位顯示為層：<strong>@layersSetting</strong>"

msgid "The name of the icon"
msgstr "圖示的名稱"

msgid "Icon Style"
msgstr "圖示樣式"

msgid "The style of the icon"
msgstr "圖示的樣式"

msgid "Icon Settings"
msgstr "圖示設定"

msgid "The additional class settings for the icon"
msgstr "圖示的其他類別設定"

msgid "Icons"
msgstr "圖示"

msgid "A Font Awesome icon"
msgstr "Font Awesome 圖示"

msgid "Solid"
msgstr "持續亮起"

msgid "Regular"
msgstr "標準"

msgid "Light"
msgstr "亮"

msgid "Duotone"
msgstr "雙色調"

msgid "Thin"
msgstr "精簡"

msgid "Kit Uploads"
msgstr "套件上傳"

msgid "This changes the style of the icon. Please note that this is not available for all icons, and for some of the icons this is only available in the pro version. If the icon does not render properly in the , the icon does not support that style. Notably, brands do not support any styles. See @iconLink for more information."
msgstr "這會變更圖示的樣式。 請注意，這並非適用於所有圖示，而對於部分圖示，這僅適用於 Pro 版本。 如果圖示未適當地呈現，則圖示不支援該樣式。 值得注意的是，品牌不支援任何樣式。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 @iconLink。"

msgid "Icon Set"
msgstr "圖示集"

msgid "Choose the Font Awesome icon set"
msgstr "選擇 Font Awesome 圖示集"

msgid "Classic"
msgstr "標準"

msgid "Sharp"
msgstr "清晰"

msgid "Additional Classes"
msgstr "其他類別"

msgid "Use space separated classes for additional manual icon tagging / settings."
msgstr "針對其他手動圖示標記/設定使用以空格區隔的類別。"

msgid "Duotone Settings"
msgstr "雙色調設定"

msgid "Duotone provides a version of every icon in Font Awesome that has two distinct shades of color. They’re great for adding more of your brand or an illustrative quality to the icons in your project. See @duotoneLink for more information. Note that duotone only works with the Pro version of Font Awesome."
msgstr "雙色調提供 Font Awesome 中每一個圖示的版本，具有兩種不同的顏色深淺度。 它們很適合將更多的品牌或說明性品質新增至專案中的圖示。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 @duotoneLink。 請注意，雙色調僅適用於 Pro 版本的 Font Awesome。"

msgid "the Font Awesome guide to duotone"
msgstr "Font Awesome 雙色調手冊"

msgid "Swap Opacity?"
msgstr "交換不透明度？"

msgid "Use to swap the default opacity of each duotone icon’s layers. This will make an icon’s primary layer have the default opacity of 40% rather than its secondary layer."
msgstr "用來交換每一個雙色調圖示層的預設不透明度。 這將使圖示的主要層具有 40% 的預設不透明度，而不是其次要層。"

msgid "Layer Opacity"
msgstr "層不透明度"

msgid "By default the secondary layer in a duotone icon is set to 40% opacity (via an opacity 0.4; rule in Font Awesome’s support CSS). You can explicitly set the opacity of a duotone icon’s layer by using CSS custom properties either in your style sheets or by setting them manually below. New to custom properties? Here are some @cssLink."
msgstr "依預設，雙色調圖示中的次要層設為 40% 不透明度（透過不透明度 0.4；Font Awesome 支援 CSS 中的規則）。 您可以在樣式表中使用 CSS 自訂內容，或在下面手動設定它們，來明確設定雙色調圖示層的不透明度。 自訂內容的新增功能？ 以下是一些 @cssLink。"

msgid "places to set them"
msgstr "設定它們的位置"

msgid "Primary Layer Opacity"
msgstr "主要層不透明度"

msgid "Opacity of the primary duotone layer."
msgstr "主要雙色調層的不透明度。"

msgid "Secondary Layer Opacity"
msgstr "次要層不透明度"

msgid "Opacity of the secondary duotone layer."
msgstr "次要雙色調層的不透明度。"

msgid "Inherit Duotone Colors?"
msgstr "繼承雙色調顏色？"

msgid "Check this box to inherit the duotone colors from CSS. Uncheck to manually set the colors below."
msgstr "勾選此方框以從 CSS 繼承雙色調顏色。 取消勾選以手動設定下面的顏色。"

msgid "Layer Color"
msgstr "層顏色"

msgid "Like all other Font Awesome icons, duotone icons automatically inherit CSS size and color. A duotone icon consists of a primary and secondary layer. By default, The secondary layer is given an opacity of 40% so that it appears as a lighter shade of the icon’s inherited or directly set color. Using CSS custom properties, we’ve also added some color hooks to a duotone icon’s primary and secondary layers. New to custom properties? Here are some @cssLink."
msgstr "與所有其他 Font Awesome 圖示一樣，雙色調圖示會自動繼承 CSS 大小及顏色。 雙色調圖示由主要及次要層組成。 依預設，次要層的不透明度為 40%，因此它會顯示為圖示繼承或直接設定顏色的淺色。 使用 CSS 自訂內容，我們也將一些顏色連結鉤新增至雙色調圖示的主要及次要層。 自訂內容的新增功能？ 以下是一些 @cssLink。"

msgid "Primary Layer Color"
msgstr "主要層顏色"

msgid "Secondary Layer Color"
msgstr "次要層顏色"

msgid "Icon Mask"
msgstr "圖示遮罩"

msgid "Masking is used to combine two icons to create one single-color shape. Use it with Power Transforms for some really awesome effects. Masks are great when you do want your background color to show through. See @maskingLink for more information. Note that masking only works with the SVG version of Font Awesome."
msgstr "遮罩是用來結合兩個圖示，以建立單一顏色形狀。 將它與 Power Transform 搭配使用，以取得一些非常棒的效果。 當您想要顯示背景顏色時，遮罩是很棒的。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 @maskingLink。 請注意，遮罩只適用於 SVG 版本的 Font Awesome。"

msgid "the Font Awesome guide to masking"
msgstr "Font Awesome 遮罩手冊"

msgid "This changes the style of the masking icon. Please note that this is not available for all icons, and for some of the icons this is only available in the pro version. If the icon does not render properly in the preview above, the icon does not support that style. Notably, brands do not support any styles. See @iconLink for more information."
msgstr "這會變更遮罩圖示的樣式。 請注意，這並非適用於所有圖示，而對於部分圖示，這僅適用於 Pro 版本。 如果圖示在上述預覽中未適當地呈現，則圖示不支援該樣式。 值得注意的是，品牌不支援任何樣式。 如需相關資訊，請參閱 @iconLink。"

msgid "the Font Awesome `How to use` guide"
msgstr "Font Awesome《使用方法》手冊"

msgid "Missing value for Font Awesome Power Transform %value. Please see @iconLink for information on correct values."
msgstr "Font Awesome Power Transform %value 遺漏值。 如需正確值的相關資訊，請參閱 @iconLink。"

msgid "Missing type value for Font Awesome Power Transform. Please see @iconLink for information on correct values."
msgstr "Font Awesome Power Transform 遺漏類型值。 如需正確值的相關資訊，請參閱 @iconLink。"

msgid "Invalid icon name %value. Please see @iconLink for correct icon names, or turn off validation in the Font Awesome settings if you are trying to use custom icon names."
msgstr "圖示名稱 %value 無效。 請參閱 @iconLink 以取得正確的圖示名稱，如果您嘗試使用自訂圖示名稱，請在 Font Awesome 設定中關閉驗證。"

